name=Wabbajack Crowns
id=WabbajackCrowns
author=Wabbajack
modversion=1.0.0
versionMin=42.0.0
require=WabbajackCore
description=One crown per skill, and only one player on the server may hold each. A crown is awarded to whoever stands highest in that skill, and it does not change hands because somebody out-levels the holder - it moves only when the holder dies. Then it passes to the next highest. One survivor can hold every crown at once, and will be hunted for it.
